Package: carspeed
Name: CarSpeed
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Your speed and the speed limit, always in view.
 Keep your eyes on the road. CarSpeed shows a small floating bubble with your
 current speed and the posted speed limit from Vietmap Live or GOFA while the
 navigation app runs in the background - on the CarPlay screen when you are
 connected, otherwise on your iPhone.
 .
 Features:
  - Current speed and speed limit from Vietmap Live and GOFA
  - Shows on the CarPlay screen, or on iPhone when no car is connected
  - Stays on for the whole drive and hides when you open the app again
  - 18 bubble styles, from a compact disc to an analog speedometer
  - Drag to move, pinch to resize, sizes saved separately for iPhone and CarPlay
  - Tap to jump back to the navigation app, hold to close it
  - Preview any style right from Settings
 .
 Set it up in Settings > CarSpeed. Changes apply instantly.
 .
 Compatibility: iOS 15 and later, rootless jailbreaks (Dopamine, palera1n).
Maintainer: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Author: AnLai <laihoangan123456@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Icon: file:///var/jb/Library/PreferenceBundles/CarSpeedPrefs.bundle/CarSpeed.png
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader, firmware (>= 15.0)
Conflicts: com.anlai97.speedpop
Replaces: com.anlai97.speedpop
